{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 今日宣佈 2026 App Store 奬項的決選名單，共有 45 款應用程式及遊戲獲選為最終候選。獲勝者將於未來數週內正式公佈。這次評選涵蓋 Apple 的多個作業系統平台，包括 iOS、iPadOS、macOS、tvOS、visionOS 以及 watchOS，各自設有專屬的決選項目。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"文章配圖\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/iPhone-Store-Finalists-Apps-2026.jpg\" width=\"1500\"/></figure>\n<h2>iPhone 年度最佳應用與遊戲決選</h2>\n<p>在 iPhone 平台的年度最佳應用與遊戲類別中，有多款具特色的產品入圍。<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/elevenreader-read-books-aloud/id6479373050/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ElevenReader</a> 因其能以自然流暢的人工智能語音朗讀文字而獲選。<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/not-boring-camera/id6737783441/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">(Not Boring) Camera</a> 則主打將 iPhone 轉化為可自定義的復古相機體驗。<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/raylie-flight-view-guide/id6793443320/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Raylie</a> 提供針對每次航班的個人化導覽旅程。遊戲方面，<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ball-x-pit/id6738703497/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BALL x PIT</a> 突破傳統打磚塊遊戲框架；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dave-the-diver/id6759962259/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DAVE THE DIVER</a> 讓玩家探索深海世界；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gambonanza/id6747752407/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gambonanza</a> 則重新定義了國際象棋規則。</p>\n<h2>文化影響獎決選特點</h2>\n<p>除了技術創新，Apple 亦強調應用程序的文化影響力，並列出一系列「年度文化影響應用與遊戲」決選名單。<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/brilliant-learn-math-coding/id913335252/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliant</a> 致力於教授數學與科學基礎知識；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/chilli-take-action-today/id1645549437/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chilli</a> 幫助用戶輕鬆參與環保政治行動；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/hearing-buddy-speech-to-text/id6747363502/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hearing Buddy</a> 協助聾人及聽障人士跟隨對話；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/karrot-buy-sell-locally/id1018769995/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Karrot</a> 促進鄰裡間的循環經濟模式；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/setlog-friends-camera/id6587576438/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">setlog</a> 旨在為社交媒體帶來更多真實性；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/unedo-spanish-games-stories/id6503170902/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Unedo</a> 以趣味方式引導西班牙語學習之旅。</p>\n<p>此外，<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/and-roger/id6761811652/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">and Roger</a> 講述感人且常具挑戰性的個人故事；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/consume-me/id6769877287/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Consume Me</a> 探討飲食失調的現實面；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/pancitomerge/id6759935383/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PancitoMerge</a> 慶祝墨西哥餐飲文化；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/sago-mini-jinjas-garden/id6477492925/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sago Mini Jinja’s Garden</a> 為家庭提供共同遊玩的方式；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/spilled/id6752525411/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spilled!</a> 讓清理受汙染水道變得充滿樂趣；<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/tiny-bookshop/id6766267906/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tiny Bookshop</a> 營造溫馨且包容的社區氛圍。</p>\n<h2>獲獎名單發佈時間安排</h2>\n<p>Apple 表示，本年度的獲勝者將於未來幾週內陸續揭曉。完整決選名單可在 Apple Newsroom 瀏覽。此次評選由 App Store 編輯團隊負責挑選，反映各平台應用生態的最新趨勢與創意成就。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/11/meet-the-2026-app-store-award-finalists/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T16:24:39.613695+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":892,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:41:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T16:18:00.655525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T16:18:00.655525+00:00","content_hash":"94c58aa85930c7c7fe2976cef02fef0b818ac4e684a00e4a291811dbc48b29e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}